MDL102 and MDL104, latent case: a whitespace-only last line without a final
newline is harmless today (the pre-processor only rewrites a line when it
meets its '\n'). The file loads and users.email is masked; the linter still
reports the latent risk.
-- scenario --
tool: mydumper
versions: >= v0.19.3-1
args: --defaults-file /work/defaults.cnf --database app
lint: MDL102, MDL104, MDL405
expect config-loaded: true
expect exit: 0
expect connected: true
expect column app.users.email: masked
when kb:table-sections-ignored
# F17: this mydumper loses every table section (MDL511).
lint: MDL102, MDL104, MDL405, MDL511
expect column app.users.email: plaintext
end
-- defaults.cnf.esc --
[client]\nhost=mysql\nuser=e2e\npassword=e2e-password\n\n[mydumper]\nthreads=2\n\n[`app`.`users`]\n`email`=random_string\n\x20\x20
